    "heading": "Round Down",
    "lineStart": 13598,
    "lineEnd": 13600
  },
  "section": "8.124",
  "rulesText": "Whenever you divide or multiply a number in the game, round down if you end up with a fraction, even if the fraction is one-half or greater. Some rules make an exception and tell you to round up."
}
